        "created_at": "2013-04-20T19:44:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I mean the total on just the ships proper.&nbsp; They have a total that can be tracked while the individual Techs have W/D points.&nbsp; It's a way to keep track of the total while still keeping track of the components without covering your entire panel with tokens.&nbsp; I would still use the tokens for the Tech.&nbsp; I don't know that I should say anything about how high I think it'd need to go, considering the non-disclosure agreement I metaphorically signed with my $40.</p>",
